// Test: error.a-bare-read-of-a-block-keyword-parameter
typealias Integer = int(i64.min to i64.max)

function weigh(while Integer) returns Integer
	return 1 + while
end 'weigh'

function main() returns ExitCode
	return weigh(41)
end 'main'
---
CompilerError:
error E2015: <fragment>:5:13: Unsupported: reading 'while' as a value here — it is a legal DECLARED name, but the token scans that re-derive Maxon's block structure read a bare `while` in this position as block structure and have no scope to tell them otherwise. Pass it under a different name, or read a differently-named binding
